&quot;mitzvah,&quot; right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed<br /> <br /> EDIT: unless you talked about Mitzuveh and Mitzvah. I thought you meant the same word. Mitzvah is &quot;commandment&quot;. Perhaps you meant Metzuveh? That would mean &quot;being commanded&quot;. Passive verb, more or less.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 10-16-2019, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-16T15:20:00-07:00","id":1341718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1341715#post1341715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed<br /> <br /> EDIT: unless you talked about Mitzuveh and Mitzvah. I thought you meant the same word. Mitzah is &quot;commandment&quot;. Perhaps you meant Metzuveh? That would mean &quot;being commanded&quot;. Passive verb, more or less.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u00af\\_(\u30c4)_/\u00af<br /> <br /> I don't know enough to answer that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T00:30:54-07:00","id":1341809,"title":"","content":"Lol- well, just say which word in English you want to use, and I'll tell you the Hebrew translation. The easiest path, I think :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T09:37:25-07:00","id":1341880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1341809#post1341809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lol- well, just say which word in English you want to use, and I'll tell you the Hebrew translation. The easiest path, I think :P</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Commanding&quot; is the word I think best fits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T11:29:49-07:00","id":1341908,"title":"","content":"That would be Tzivui. Yeah, it is short and may not look nice, but that's the word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T12:12:02-07:00","id":1341915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1341908#post1341908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That would be Tzivui. Yeah, it is short and may not look nice, but that's the word.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u05e6\u05d9\u05d5\u05d5\u05d4?<br /> <br /> /10char","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T12:52:05-07:00","id":1341924,"title":"","content":"No, that means &quot;he commanded&quot;- it should be \u05e6\u05d9\u05d5\u05d5\u05d9<br /> <br /> If you wish to keep discussing the best word, perhaps we should move to PMs? I feel bad for derailing this thread into &quot;all possible ways to use &quot;command&quot; in Hebrew&quot; :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T13:11:41-07:00","id":1341928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1341924#post1341924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, that means &quot;he commanded&quot;- it should be \u05e6\u05d9\u05d5\u05d5\u05d9<br /> <br /> If you wish to keep discussing the best word, perhaps we should move to PMs? I feel bad for derailing this thread into &quot;all possible ways to use &quot;command&quot; in Hebrew&quot; :P</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that should do it, actually, &quot;tzivui&quot; is fine aesthetically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T06:52:49-07:00","id":1343399,"title":"","content":"That is a very cool 2ed conversion, the fourth Mind Attainment is especially interesting. But I wonder if the constant <i>Know Nature</i> doesn't make them ping the Peripheral Sight so often that discretion becomes very difficult. It also makes me wish they had full <i>Mental Scan</i> so they would have a chance to go terribly crazy or incredibly sane from the constant insights into people's hearts, a bit like Hao Asakura in the manga.<br /> <br /> I see a bit of overlap with the Mind's Eye Attainment, perhaps they could have a waiver on the mana cost for interacting with goetia for a scene. The ritual is how they reap greater benefits and extend them to their allies. But if they need a quick and dirty way to deal with an Astral being, they would be up to the task.<br /> <br /> Overall, this is a pretty nice take on the Legacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-24-2019, 10:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T09:59:52-07:00","id":1343451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1343399#post1343399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is a very cool 2ed conversion, the fourth Mind Attainment is especially interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br /> For the fourth Mind Attainment I initially had it function exactly like the spell with the appropriate reach options (could call any goetia, required a place to meditate into the Astral to call goetia from the Oneiros) but decided that restricting it to <i>only</i> your own goetia and removing the requirement to be able to meditated into the Astral was much more thematic.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But I wonder if the constant <i>Know Nature</i> doesn't make them ping the Peripheral Sight so often that discretion becomes very difficult. </div> </div> </div>I honestly didn't think about that. In my mind it's a &quot;passive&quot; effect and so wouldn't ping Peripheral Sight, but it might be interesting if it did, maybe give the option to suppress the ability for a scene with a point of Willpower?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It also makes me wish they had full <i>Mental Scan</i> so they would have a chance to go terribly crazy or incredibly sane from the constant insights into people's hearts, a bit like Hao Asakura in the manga. </div> </div> </div>My problem with <i>Mental Scan</i> (and pretty much all low level attainments that are Withstood) is that I want Legacy Attainments to be useful with only the minimum requirements and <i>Mental Scan</i> at one dot in Mind is a whiff 100% of the time. The only reason I have <i>Emotional Urging</i> as an Attainment is because it was in the 1e write-up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I see a bit of overlap with the Mind's Eye Attainment, perhaps they could have a waiver on the mana cost for interacting with goetia for a scene. The ritual is how they reap greater benefits and extend them to their allies. But if they need a quick and dirty way to deal with an Astral being, they would be up to the task. </div> </div> </div>The benefits to the <i>Exorcist's Eye</i> as a Legacy Attainment is that it's always on, allows you to see conduits, and doesn't require the use of Active Mage Sight (which has penalties associated with it and can only be used for a minute without the expenditure of a point of Willpower).<br /> <br /> The third Legacy Attainment grants the interaction ability while also extending the effect to equipment without the expenditure of mana.<br /> <br /> If you had other ideas for those two attainments I'd be happy to hear them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Overall, this is a pretty nice take on the Legacy. </div> </div> </div>Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 05-05-2021, 07:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T12:02:51-07:00","id":1343477,"title":"","content":"Here are my current ideas for those Attainments<br /> <br /> Mind 2<br /> <br /> A variation of Command Spirit that allows the mage to force a spirit to create a talen of up to [Mind] dots. If the target is willing or has subordinated themselves to the Key Bearer's authority, then their Withstand can be bypassed.<br /> <br /> I wish this could be used with goetia too but it would either need more Arcana or an appropriate restriction. Reach is assigned to instant use and sensory range.<br /> <br /> This Attainment is a nod to the giant worm that was given to Solomon to dig out his temple and transform the stones.<br /> <br /> Spirit 3<br /> <br /> This is a weird idea and also requires Mind 3. The mage summons a mundane object that had emotional significance to them from their memories, they then shape spiritual Essence into its form and make it affect both spirit and goetia, but it does not make it visible. So a birdwatcher could make a gesture focusing his binoculars and they would be effectively there, a surgeon would have his scalpel, a fencer his rapier, a policeman his gun and a handyman his tools. This makes them look very eerie to anyone without the appropriate sights (or frightening if they are within the Realms Invisible where all this becomes evident), their mental discipline manifesting tangible effects.<br /> <br /> However, the mage can also summon objects from any one of his memories if he convinces the goetia who oversees it to help. This gives them an incentive to constantly explore their Oneiros.<br /> <br /> The Attainment has Reach assigned to instant cast, allows them to summon an item up to size 5 and it auto renews only while it remains in contact with the mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-24-2019, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T14:53:56-07:00","id":1343498,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1343477#post1343477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here are my current ideas for those Attainments<br /> <br /> Mind 2<br /> <br /> A variation of Command Spirit that allows the mage to force a spirit to create a talen of up to [Mind] dots. If the target is willing or has subordinated themselves to the Key Bearer's authority, then their Withstand can be bypassed.<br /> <br /> I wish this could be used with goetia too but it would either need more Arcana or an appropriate restriction. Reach is assigned to instant use and sensory range.<br /> <br /> This Attainment is a nod to the giant worm that was given to Solomon to dig out his temple and transform the stones.</div> </div> </div> </div>Creating a fetish is already the fourth attainment, and creating a talen would require <s>the same dot level (and for Mage purposes is, imo, the same spell)</s> three dots in Spirit (I don't know why you have Mind as the scale of power) similar to the single use items craftable with Prime.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Spirit 3<br /> <br /> This is a weird idea and also requires Mind 3. The mage summons a mundane object that had emotional significance to them from their memories, they then shape spiritual Essence into its form and make it affect both spirit and goetia, but it does not make it visible. So a birdwatcher could make a gesture focusing his binoculars and they would be effectively there, a surgeon would have his scalpel, a fencer his rapier, a policeman his gun and a handyman his tools. This makes them look very eerie to anyone without the appropriate sights (or frightening if they are within the Realms Invisible where all this becomes evident), their mental discipline manifesting tangible effects.<br /> <br /> However, the mage can also summon objects from any one of his memories if he convinces the goetia who oversees it to help. This gives them an incentive to constantly explore their Oneiros.<br /> <br /> The Attainment has Reach assigned to instant cast, allows them to summon an item up to size 5 and it auto renews only while it remains in contact with the mage. </div> </div> </div>I think this would be great for a legacy like Uncrowned Kings, but seems radically off theme for the Clavicularius.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 10-24-2019, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-25T03:52:05-07:00","id":1343553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1343498#post1343498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(I don't know why you have Mind as the scale of power)</div> </div> </div> </div>Dot rating of Talen equal to Potency, and Potency equal to Mind dots?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-25T08:19:48-07:00","id":1343589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1341513-2e-legacy-update-clavicularius?p=1343553#post1343553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dot rating of Talen equal to Potency, and Potency equal to Mind dots?</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand the mechanical implication.<br /> <br /> What I don't understand are why he's suggesting a spell that would be purely Spirit for the Mind 2 optional when: 1) that's not one of the ones I asked for suggestions on (it was part of the 1e legacy so it stays) and 2) the attainment itself is wholly a Spirit ability, with no Mind component.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T10:13:31-07:00","id":1344215,"title":"","content":"My bad, I thought you wanted an idea for Exorcist's Eye as well as the two ritual Attainments.<br /> <br /> The Mind thing is a leftover idea from wanting to make goetic talens but not being sure how (probably with conjunctional Spirit 4). The idea is that a talen is a very simple thing for a spirit to make. If you have its cooperation you could perform a talen creation rite as the Attainment rather than tear the power from them with Weaving (or perhaps Fraying). But yeah, its not simple enough that an instant action could cover it.<br /> <br /> An ephemeral being wouldn't be too happy after being forcibly bound to a fetish. Similarly, the negotiations for it to willingly go into one would be demanding. A talen seemed like a tithe the Key Bearers could reasonably ask for or negotiate towards, a complimentary option.<br /> <br /> It could reinforce the idea of them ruling over these spirit (ruling over rampant emotions), but that is probably more of what the Lords of the Inanimate do. The significant object summoning is, as you mentioned, more resonant with the Uncrowned Kings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-28-2019, 08:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}